":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[75,80,64,25,83,69],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1011102","helmet":"WP1012902","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1064","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[75,80,64,25,83,69],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1011102","helmet":"WP1012902","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1032","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[75,80,64,25,83,69],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1011102","helmet":"WP1012902","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10042","city":"CS1033","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[75,80,64,25,83,69],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006002","armor":"WP1011102","helmet":"WP1012902","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国武将，五虎将马超之女。马姬早年跟随马超流离各处，也经历了许多次的生离死别，直到马超加入了刘备势力才安稳下来。在西川没什么亲人的马姬，将注意力全部放在了喜爱的武艺上，师出父亲马超，常常和叔叔马岱打的不分上下。后被嫁给刘备之子刘理，但刘理早逝，此后再无记载。","tc":"蜀國武將，五虎將馬超之女。馬姬早年跟隨馬超流離各處，也經歷了許多次的生離死別，直到馬超加入了劉備勢力才安穩下來。在西川沒什么親人的馬姬，將注意力全部放在了喜愛的武藝上，師出父親馬超，常常和叔叔馬岱打的不分上下。后被嫁給劉備之子劉理，但劉理早逝，此后再無記載。","en":"An officer of Shu and the daughter of Ma Chao, one of the Five Tiger Generals. In her early years, Ma Ji followed Ma Chao through endless wanderings and experienced many partings of life and death, finding stability only after Ma Chao joined Liu Bei's faction. With few relatives in Xichuan, she poured all her energy into her beloved martial arts. Trained by her father Ma Chao, she could often fight her uncle Ma Dai to a standstill. She was later married to Liu Li, a son of Liu Bei. After Liu Li's early death, no further record of her exists.","jp":"蜀の武将。五虎大将軍・馬超の娘。馬姫は幼少期より馬超に従って各地を転々とし、幾多の生離死別を経験したが、馬超が劉備勢力に加わってからはようやく平穏を得た。西川には身寄りが少なかったため、好んでいた武芸の鍛錬に没頭する。父・馬超から教えを受け、叔父の馬岱と互角に立ち回るほどであった。のちに劉備の子・劉理に嫁いだが、劉理は早世し、その後の消息についての記録はない。","kr":"촉나라의 무장으로, 오호대장군 마초의 딸이다. 마희는 초년에 마초를 따라 각지를 떠돌며 수많은 생사이별을 겪었으나, 마초가 유비 세력에 합류한 뒤에야 비로소 안정을 찾았다. 서천에 일가친척이 거의 없었던 마희는 좋아하는 무예에 온 마음을 쏟았는데, 부친 마초에게 무예를 배워 종종 숙부 마대와 호각을 다투곤 했다. 훗날 유비의 아들 유리에게 출가하였으나 유리가 요절하였고, 그 이후의 기록은 전해지지 않는다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ11049","remark":"","surname":"马","surnameTc":"馬","surnameEn":"Ma","surnameJp":"馬","surnameKr":"마","surnameOther":"","name":"姬","nameTc":"姬","nameEn":"Ji","nameJp":"姫","nameKr":"희","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"马姬","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"214","city":"CS1032","gender":"1","rule":"75","force":"80","wise":"64","politics":"25","charm":"83","will":"69","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"10","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"10","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"85/34/34/34/34/22/50/34","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1002602;1000205","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1007505","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5600","battleSoulPoint":"6400","debateSoulPoint":"4100","strategy":"1007215","strategy2":"1000905;1000115","professions":"0/2/4/3/0/0/2/1/0/1/1/1/2/3/5/1/1/1/1/2/0/2/2/1","attribute2":"79/82/65/25/83/72","morality":"5","compatible":"37","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"195","